**Decision:** Improve the dark mode toggle button in `site/app.js` to update its label and icon when toggled, so it accurately reflects the current state (shows "☀️ Light mode" in dark mode, "🌙 Dark mode" in light mode). This is a single-file change, low risk, improves UX across all 11 pages since they share the same navigation.

**Files to rewrite:** `site/app.js`, `MEMORY.md`

**Risk:** Very low — only modifies the existing click handler to also update button text and aria-label. No HTML changes, no new dependencies.

